=2 Walkthrough
!Seed Afterglow.jpg|right|Seed Afterglow
You must find 9 **{p:Seed Afterglows|Seed Afterglow}** in {z:Fei'Yin}: with red, orange, yellow, green, cerulean, blue, golden, silver, and white radiance.
* You have 30 minutes (Earth time) to gather the 9 **Afterglows**. If you do not collect them all in 30 minutes zone out and back in to begin the process over again.
* The **Seed Afterglows** move periodically, but stay in the same general areas, refer to the maps below.
** **NOTE:** The {c=yellow:yellow} **Seed Afterglow** can spawn in 2 different rooms. If it's not in the big room, check the small circular room at (H/I-9).
* **Recommended Route:**
** Starting from HP #1 (K-8) > {c=yellow:yellow} (big room) > **{c=green:green}** > **{c=orange:orange}** > **{c=red:red}** > {c=yellow:yellow} (small room) > **A** > {c=white:white} > **{c=#498d9a:cerulean}** > **{c=#b39700:golden}** > **{c=silver:silver}** > **B** > **{c=blue:blue}**

!Fei'Yin1- Seed Afterglow.jpg||
!Fei'Yin2- Seed Afterglow.jpg||
Once you collect all 9, you will be given the option to get either {@k} {k:Mark of Seed} (to continue to the next mission) or an {@k} {k:Azure Key} for a reward.
* You may only repeat this process of gathering **Seed Afterglows** once per Earth day.
* Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

=2 "A Crystalline Prophecy" Key
* Use the {@k} {k:Azure Key} (Level 60) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

